WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.592 --> 00:00:22.466
&gt;&gt; HIS PARENTS ASKED HIM TO

00:00:18.095 --> 00:00:24.668
LEAVE FIVE TIMES, GAVE HIM A

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:25.235
THOUSAND DOLLARS TO FIND A

00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:26.803
PLACE, BUT HE DIDN'T TAKE THE

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:29.272
HINT.

00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:31.141
SO THEY WENT TO COURT.

00:00:26.937 --> 00:00:32.743
THE MAN CHILD CLAIMS HE

00:00:29.406 --> 00:00:33.043
SHOULDN'T HAVE TO LEAVE BECAUSE

00:00:31.274 --> 00:00:35.045
HE DOESN'T WANT TO LEAVE.

00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:36.146
WATCH.

00:00:33.176 --> 00:00:37.948
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT A BURDEN TO THEM IN

00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:38.615
THE HOME.

00:00:36.279 --> 00:00:43.887
THEY DON'T PROVIDE LAUNDRY OR

00:00:38.081 --> 00:00:47.174
FOOD.

00:00:38.749 --> 00:00:47.174
IT'S REALLY A MOOT POINT FOR

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.174
THEM TO SEEK ME TO BE OBJECTIVE.

00:00:48.959 --> 00:00:53.530
WE ARE INTERESTED TO KNOW WHAT

00:00:52.362 --> 00:00:56.500
SHE THOUGHT.

00:00:53.663 --> 00:00:57.968
SHE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:56.633 --> 00:01:00.170
HE'S 30 YEARS OLD.

00:00:58.101 --> 00:01:02.305
HE DOESN'T WANT TO LEAVE.

00:01:00.303 --> 00:01:04.574
SHOULD HE BE FORCED TO LEAVE?

00:01:02.439 --> 00:01:09.312
&gt;&gt; WHY?

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:11.381
A THIRD OF 35-YEAR-OLDS LIVE

00:01:09.446 --> 00:01:11.715
WITH THEIR PARENTS IN THIS

00:01:11.515 --> 00:01:15.285
COUNTRY.

00:01:11.848 --> 00:01:16.953
HE WANTS TO BE WITH HIS MOM.

00:01:15.419 --> 00:01:19.790
HE'S NOT READY TO MOVE ON.

00:01:17.087 --> 00:01:21.758
YOU WOULD THINK HIS PARENTS

00:01:19.923 --> 00:01:26.396
WOULD WELCOME HIM THERE.

00:01:21.892 --> 00:01:25.796
HIS MOM WOULD WANT TO

00:01:25.796 --> 00:01:25.829
HIS MOM WOULD WANT HO

00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:26.696
HIS MOM WOULD WANT HIM TO LIVE

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:31.501
THERE.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:34.204
&gt;&gt; IF AT THE AGE OF 30 YOU ARE

00:01:31.635 --> 00:01:36.873
NOT READY TO LEAVE YOUR MOM'S

00:01:34.337 --> 00:01:39.743
BASEMENT, WHY ARE YOU ABLE TO

00:01:37.007 --> 00:01:40.811
DRINK OR DRIVE A CAR OR SERVE IN

00:01:39.876 --> 00:01:43.780
THE MILITARY?

00:01:40.944 --> 00:01:44.147
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW HE DOES THOSE

00:01:43.914 --> 00:01:47.784
THINGS.

00:01:44.281 --> 00:01:50.053
HE SAID HE HAS A BEDROOM.

00:01:47.918 --> 00:01:50.954
HE DIDN'T SAY HE LIVED IN THE

00:01:50.187 --> 00:01:57.627
BASEMENT.

00:01:51.088 --> 00:01:59.062
WHAT'S WRONG WITH LIVING WITH

00:01:57.761 --> 00:02:00.764
YOUR PARENTS?

00:01:59.196 --> 00:02:04.935
IN THE FUTURE, MAYBE HE WILL

00:02:00.897 --> 00:02:06.837
HAVE A NICE HOUSE AND MANSION

00:02:05.068 --> 00:02:08.105
THAT THEY WOULDN'T SPEND ON

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.272
LAWYERS, BUT THEY'LL SPEND ON

00:02:08.238 --> 00:02:11.908
HIM.

00:02:09.406 --> 00:02:20.417
&gt;&gt; I'M TRYING TO DISCERN A THEME

00:02:12.042 --> 00:02:24.321
TO APPLY TO GET THINGS FOR FREE,

00:02:20.551 --> 00:02:24.755
IF I REALLY LOVE A ROLEX, DO I

00:02:24.455 --> 00:02:28.959
GET IT?

00:02:24.888 --> 00:02:31.628
&gt;&gt; IT'S A PARENT AND CHILD.

00:02:29.093 --> 00:02:33.297
SHE'S ALWAYS A MOM.

00:02:31.762 --> 00:02:35.032
HE'S ALWAYS A SON.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.700
THEY SHOULDN'T HIRE A LAWYER AND

00:02:35.165 --> 00:02:39.470
GO AGAINST EACH OTHER IN COURT.

00:02:36.834 --> 00:02:42.139
&gt;&gt; WHAT IF I LOVE THE WATCH, AND

00:02:39.603 --> 00:02:43.507
I NEED TO KNOW WHAT TIME IT IS.

00:02:42.272 --> 00:02:45.609
I LOVE THAT WATCH.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:48.378
IT'S A SINCERE LOVE.

00:02:45.742 --> 00:02:50.180
WHY WOULD THEY CALL THE COPS ON

00:02:48.512 --> 00:02:52.449
ME IF I JUST TAKE IT?

00:02:50.314 --> 00:02:54.418
&gt;&gt; SHE GAVE BIRTH TO THE CHILD.

00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:57.121
YOU DIDN'T GIVE BIRTH TO THE

00:02:54.551 --> 00:03:00.424
WATCH.

00:02:57.254 --> 00:03:03.026
THE MOTHER SHOULD UNDERSTAND,

00:03:00.557 --> 00:03:05.796
IT'S HER RESPONSIBILITY.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.697
IT'S HER CHILD NO MATTER HOW OLD

00:03:05.929 --> 00:03:09.733
THE CHILD IS.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:10.367
&gt;&gt; SO YOU CAN'T AGE OUT OF THIS

00:03:09.867 --> 00:03:12.136
ARRANGEMENT.

00:03:10.501 --> 00:03:14.771
ONCE YOU ARE BORN, YOU HAVE A

00:03:12.269 --> 00:03:16.573
MORAL AND LEGAL RIGHT TO SPONGE

00:03:14.905 --> 00:03:18.575
OFF YOUR PARENTS FOREVER?

00:03:16.707 --> 00:03:19.076
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK IT'S SPONGING

00:03:18.709 --> 00:03:21.145
OFF.

00:03:19.209 --> 00:03:22.579
HE LOVES HIS MOTHER.

00:03:21.278 --> 00:03:25.682
MICHAEL LOVES HIS MOMMY.

00:03:22.713 --> 00:03:26.083
HE WANTS TO BE WITH HER UNTIL

00:03:25.816 --> 00:03:31.655
HE'S READY.

00:03:26.216 --> 00:03:33.257
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU CONFUSED ABOUT THE

00:03:31.788 --> 00:03:34.024
EXPLOSION OF MAN CHILDREN IN OUR

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:38.428
SOCIETY.

00:03:34.158 --> 00:03:39.863
&gt;&gt; WOMEN AND MEN 18 TO 25 ARE

00:03:38.562 --> 00:03:40.564
LIVING AT HOME WITH THEIR

00:03:39.997 --> 00:03:43.033
PARENTS.

00:03:40.697 --> 00:03:44.301
THAT'S WHAT'S HAPPENING RIGHT

00:03:43.167 --> 00:03:46.837
NOW.

00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:49.173
MAKE AMERICA GREAT AGAIN, RIGHT?

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:53.744
WE ARE MAKING IT GREAT.

00:03:49.306 --> 00:03:55.813
&gt;&gt; IT'S A SAD NEW WORLD.

